<title>UK: ScotAm says possible bidders include overseas firm.</title>
<headline>ScotAm says possible bidders include overseas firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Amicable, subject of a bid battle between Abbey National and Prudential Corp said on Wednesday it had received expressions of interest from both overseas and British firms. ScotAm chairman Sandy Stewart said that the group would be seeking offers from these potential bidders and in the meantime would delay posting out its own flotation plans.</p>
</text>
